  "text": "And yet to me not this or that<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Is always sharp or always sweet;<br>In the sloped shadow of my hat<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;I lean at rest, and drain the heat;<br>Nay more, I think some blessèd power<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Hath brought me wandering idly here:<br>In the full furnace of this hour<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;My thoughts grow keen and clear.",
  "citation": {
